msgid "Tracy"
msgstr "Tracy"

msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`tracing profiler instructions <doc_tracing_profilers>` "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"詳情請參閱 :ref:`tracing profiler instructions <doc_tracing_profilers>` 。"

msgid ""
"`Tracy <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy>`__ is an Open Source profiler that "
"runs on a wide variety of platforms, including Windows, Linux, and macOS. "
"While it is primarily a tracing profiler, it can also periodically sample "
"data like a :ref:`sampling profiler <doc_sampling_profilers>`, giving some "
"of the benefits of both approaches."
msgstr ""
"`Tracy <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy>`__ 是一款開源的效能分析器"
"（profiler），它支援非常廣泛的平台，包括 Windows、Linux 和 macOS。雖然它本質"
"上主要是一款追蹤式分析器（tracing profiler），但它也能像 :ref:`sampling "
"profiler <doc_sampling_profilers>` 那樣定期採集資料，從而讓你同時享受到這兩種"
"分析方式帶來的好處。"

msgid "Build Godot with Tracy support"
msgstr "編譯（建置）支援 Tracy 的 Godot"

msgid ""
"First, clone the latest version of the Tracy source code (\"0.13.0\" at the "
"time of writing) using Git:"
msgstr ""
"首先，使用 Git 克隆最新版本的 Tracy 原始碼（在撰寫本文時最新版本為 "
"\"0.13.0\"）："

msgid "This will create a ``tracy`` directory - you can place this anywhere."
msgstr "這將會建立一個 ``tracy`` 目錄——你可以把它放在任何你喜歡的地方。"

msgid ""
"Next, build the release templates for your platform using ``scons``, but "
"adding the ``profiler=tracy profiler_path=path/to/tracy`` arguments with the "
"real path to the ``tracy`` directory, as well as ``debug_symbols=yes`` to "
"allow Tracy's sampling features to work."
msgstr ""
"接下來，使用 ``scons`` 為你的平台編譯 release 範本。不過，你需要額外加上 "
"``profiler=tracy profiler_path=path/to/tracy`` 這兩個參數，並記得把 path/to/"
"tracy 替換成你電腦上 ``tracy`` 資料夾的真實路徑。此外，還需要加上 "
"``debug_symbols=yes`` 參數，這樣才能讓 Tracy 的取樣（sampling）功能正常工作。"

msgid ""
"You don't have to build release templates, you could also build debug "
"templates, or even the editor. However, it's generally recommended to "
"profile release templates, because that is the version your players will "
"use, and it will perform differently than other types of builds."
msgstr ""
"你其實不一定非要編譯發佈範本（release templates），也可以編譯除錯範本（debug "
"templates），甚至直接編譯編輯器本身。不過，通常還是建議大家針對“發佈範本”來進"
"行效能分析，因為這畢竟是玩家們實際玩到的版本，它的執行表現會和其他型別的建置"
"版本有所不同。"

msgid "For example, to build release templates for Windows:"
msgstr "舉個例子，如果要為 Windows 平台編譯發佈範本的話："

msgid "Get the Tracy \"server\""
msgstr "取得 Tracy 的“伺服端”"

msgid ""
"In Tracy terminology, the application you are profiling is the \"client\", "
"and the one receiving the data is the \"server\"."
msgstr ""
"在 Tracy 的術語里，你正在進行效能分析的那個應用程式（比如你的遊戲）被稱為“用"
"戶端（client）”，而負責接收這些資料的那個程式（也就是 Tracy 分析器介面）則被"
"稱為“伺服端（server）”。"

msgid ""
"If you are on Windows, you can download a pre-built ``tracy-profiler.exe`` "
"from the Tracy `releases page <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases>`_."
msgstr ""
"如果你用的是 Windows 系統，可以直接去 Tracy 的 `releases page <https://"
"github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases>`_ 下載一個已經編譯好的 ``tracy-"
"profiler.exe`` 檔案。"

msgid ""
"However, if you're on Linux or macOS, you'll either need to find a pre-built "
"binary from a package manager (like ``brew`` or ``nix``), or build it from "
"source yourself."
msgstr ""
"不過，如果你使用的是 Linux 或 macOS 系統，你要麼需要去包管理器（比如 "
"``brew`` 或 ``nix``）里找找有沒有預編譯好的二進位檔案，要麼就只能自己動手從原"
"始碼編譯一個啦。"

msgid ""
"If you do use a pre-built binary, be sure to use the same version that you "
"used when building Godot."
msgstr ""
"如果你確實想使用預編譯好的二進位檔案，請務必確保它的版本和你當初編譯 Godot 時"
"使用的版本保持一致。"

msgid "Build the Tracy server from source"
msgstr "從原始碼編譯（建置）Tracy 伺服器"

msgid ""
"In order to build Tracy, you'll need to install ``cmake``, which can be "
"downloaded from the `CMake website <https://cmake.org/download/>`_, or "
"possibly installed via a package manager (like ``brew`` or ``nix``)."
msgstr ""
"為了編譯 Tracy，你需要先安裝 ``cmake``。你可以直接從 `CMake website <https://"
"cmake.org/download/>`_ 下載，或者也可以通過包管理器（比如 ``brew`` 或 "
"``nix``）來安裝。"

msgid ""
"The full instructions for building Tracy from source can be found in the "
"`Tracy manual <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases/latest/download/"
"tracy.pdf>`_, but here is the TL;DR:"
msgstr ""
"關於如何從原始碼編譯 Tracy 的完整說明，你可以在 `Tracy manual <https://"
"github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases/latest/download/tracy.pdf>`_ 里找到。不過，"
"這裡直接給你划個重點（TL;DR）："

msgid ""
"This will place the binary at ``tracy/profiler/build/tracy-profiler`` or "
"``tracy/profiler/build/tracy-profiler.exe`` (on Windows)."
msgstr ""
"這會將可執行檔（二進位程式）放置在 ``tracy/profiler/build/tracy-profiler`` 路"
"徑下，如果你是在 Windows 系統上，那就是 ``tracy/profiler/build/tracy-"
"profiler.exe``。"

msgid "Record a trace"
msgstr "抓取追蹤記錄"

msgid "Launch the Tracy server - you'll see something like this:"
msgstr "啟動 Tracy 伺服器——你會看到類似這樣的介面："

msgid ""
"Press \"connect\". This will ensure tracy makes a connection immediately "
"when the game launches. If you forget to press \"connect\", Tracy will store "
"system events in RAM, which can quickly blow up your memory usage (see the "
"``TRACY_ON_DEMAND`` documentation)."
msgstr ""
"按下“Connect”（連接）按鈕。這一步能確保 Tracy 在遊戲啟動的瞬間就立刻建立連"
"接。如果你忘了點“Connect”，Tracy 會把所有的系統事件先暫存在記憶體（RAM）里，"
"這可能會讓你的記憶體佔用量瞬間爆表（具體可以看看關於 ``TRACY_ON_DEMAND`` 的相"
"關文件說明）。"

msgid ""
"Now, export your game using the release templates you built above, and run "
"it. As soon as both are running, and you have pressed the \"Connect\" button "
"in Tracy, you'll see data coming in:"
msgstr ""
"現在，用你剛才自己編譯好的發佈範本（release templates）匯出你的遊戲，然後執行"
"它。當遊戲和 Tracy 都在執行，並且你在 Tracy 里按下了“Connect”（連接）按鈕後，"
"馬上就能看到資料開始傳輸進來了："

msgid ""
"When you think you've gathered enough data, press the \"Stop\" button. If "
"you clicked somewhere and the box with the \"Stop\" button disappeared, you "
"can click the top-left most icon to bring it back."
msgstr ""
"當你覺得已經收集到足夠的資料時，按下“Stop”（停止）按鈕即可。如果你不小心點到"
"了別的地方，導致帶有“Stop”按鈕的那個小框框消失了，可以點擊最左上角的圖示把它"
"重新喚出來。"

msgid "Examining the trace"
msgstr "分析追蹤記錄"

msgid "Here are some of the basic controls:"
msgstr "以下是一些基礎的操作控制："

msgid "Zoom in/out with the mouse wheel"
msgstr "捲動滑鼠滾輪，就能放大或縮小檢視啦"

msgid "Right click and drag to move forward/backward on the timeline"
msgstr "右鍵點擊並拖曳以在時間軸上向前或向後移動"

msgid ""
"In the top bar, click the left and right arrow buttons by \"Frames\" to move "
"a single frame on the timeline"
msgstr ""
"在頂部的工具列里，點擊“Frames”（影格）旁邊的左右箭頭按鈕，就可以在時間軸上逐"
"影格移動啦"

msgid ""
"To learn more, see the `Tracy manual <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy/"
"releases/latest/download/tracy.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
"想瞭解更多內容，請查閱 `Tracy manual <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy/"
"releases/latest/download/tracy.pdf>`_。"
